{"slug":"FPE:-RANDOM-PAPERS-SKETCH-RP-Papers-Sketch-Quality-of-Life-57311","_id":"68e7a08ff16e09332d9dcf0b","title":"[DEPRECATED] Papers Sketch Quality of Life","game":{"_id":"68e7a08ff16e09332d9dcf08","gameId":17290493248,"name":"FPE: RANDOM PAPERS SKETCH RP","imageUrl":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":17290493248},"features":"[NO LONGER SUPPORTED]\nAugust 10th, 2026: Hey guys! This script will no longer be in support. The reason is due to the game shutting down on August 9th. It was such a huge blast making this script, however, all good things must eventually come to an end. If you've used this script and are reading this, thank you 🫡\n\n\nSmall low quality script that adds extra features, a bunch can be found in the Settings, the gear icon underneath.\n● Teleport To Lobby (Teleports you back to the Lobby where you first spawn in)\n● Morph Button + Name Textbox\n● Faceless (MUST BE ENGEL, CLAIRE, LANA, OR BUBBLE)\n● Give Paper/Book (MUST BE STUDENT)\n● OG CS Music (Replaces the Character Selection music with the one from when the game first launched)\n● Swap CS/SOC/TMale/TFem/Silly (Replaces either the Character Selection, Student OC, Male Teacher OC, Female Teacher OC, or Silly OC's musics with whatever SoundID you input\n● OG CS Screen Replica (Replictes how the Character Selection Screen looked when the game first launched, WIP) \n● Restore CS Music (Reverts the Character Selection music back to the original)","tags":["FPE","Random Papers Sketch","Papers Sketch","Fundamental Paper Education","FPE RPS"],"script":"-- v1.3 RPSQOL\nloadstring(game:HttpGet('https://codeberg.org/DemiFan54/RPS-QOL/raw/branch/main/RPSQOL.Lua', true))()","owner":{"_id":"677240922a5d8f941d2dd26b","username":"DemiFan54","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/e094604abb42f00da7d67dde4368dac7362ef643af085fcc94f14c83fa167f5a.webp","orig